></p></header><section id=\"chapters\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--default\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"How we met\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__text\"><ol class=\"cv-stem\" aria-label=\"Chapters\" data-bl-b=\"\"><li id=\"how-we-met\" class=\"cv-stem__node\"><svg class=\"cv-leaf cv-stem__leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 20C4 10 10 4 20 4c0 10-6 16-16 16z\" fill=\"var(--color-leaf)\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 20 20 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><div class=\"cv-stem__body\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Meeting</span></span><h2 class=\"cv-h cv-h--2 cv-stem__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How we met</span></h2><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose cv-prose--lead\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We met at Allison and Jamie’s wedding.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Flirty glances across the room, and an immediate connection.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the rest of the story — who noticed whom first, what was said, and what happened after the last dance.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"cv-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></div></li><li id=\"the-connection\" class=\"cv-stem__node\"><svg class=\"cv-leaf cv-stem__leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 20C4 10 10 4 20 4c0 10-6 16-16 16z\" fill=\"var(--color-leaf)\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 20 20 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><div class=\"cv-stem__body\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Connection</span></span><h2 class=\"cv-h cv-h--2 cv-stem__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The connection</span></h2><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Best friendship. Peace. Becoming better together.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Those are Tyler’s words for what this is, and they are the seed of everything on this page.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the story of how the connection became a relationship, in your own words.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"cv-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></div></li><li id=\"our-life-together\" class=\"cv-stem__node\"><svg class=\"cv-leaf cv-stem__leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 20C4 10 10 4 20 4c0 10-6 16-16 16z\" fill=\"var(--color-leaf)\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 20 20 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><div class=\"cv-stem__body\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Together</span></span><h2 class=\"cv-h cv-h--2 cv-stem__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our life together</span></h2><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The places that shaped us: the Museum of Ice Cream, Richardson Farm, Michael Jordan’s Steakhouse, food tastings, gardening together, the Madison waterfront, and Starved Rock.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">You can wander through them on Our Adventures, and borrow a few for your own weekend on Share an Adventure.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which adventures to tell in full, and the photos to go with them.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"cv-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></div></li><li id=\"love\" class=\"cv-stem__node\"><svg class=\"cv-leaf cv-stem__leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 20C4 10 10 4 20 4c0 10-6 16-16 16z\" fill=\"var(--color-leaf)\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 20 20 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><div class=\"cv-stem__body\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span></span><h2 class=\"cv-h cv-h--2 cv-stem__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love</span></h2><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We said “I love you” for the first time at Starved Rock.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which trail, what day, and who said it first are yours to tell.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"cv-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></div></li><li id=\"greater-together\" class=\"cv-stem__node\"><svg class=\"cv-leaf cv-stem__leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 20C4 10 10 4 20 4c0 10-6 16-16 16z\" fill=\"var(--color-leaf)\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 20 20 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><div class=\"cv-stem__body\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ahead</span></span><h2 class=\"cv-h cv-h--2 cv-stem__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Greater together than alone</span></h2><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Mutual support. Being each other’s rock. Home. Gratitude. A deliberate partnership.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">what the next chapter looks like, in your words.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"cv-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></div></li><li id=\"the-proposal\" class=\"cv-stem__node\"><svg class=\"cv-leaf cv-stem__leaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 20C4 10 10 4 20 4c0 10-6 16-16 16z\" fill=\"var(--color-leaf)\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 20 20 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-leaf-deep)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><div class=\"cv-stem__body\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Engagement</span></span><h2 class=\"cv-h cv-h--2 cv-stem__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The proposal</span></h2><ul class=\"cv-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"cv-chip cv-chip--info\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"cv-prose\"><